{
    "comment": "비밀번호 재설정 — 메일 링크로 들어오는 화면이라 토큰·이메일이 URL 질의로 온다. 화면은 넷 중 하나만 보인다: 토큰 무효 / 재설정 완료 / 입력 폼 / (로그인 상태일 때) 위의 두 모달.",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "layout_name": "auth/reset_password",
    "extends": "_user_base",
    "meta": {
        "title": "$t:auth.reset_password.title",
        "guest_only": true
    },
    "data_sources": [
        {
            "id": "tokenValidation",
            "label_key": "$t:editor.data_source.tokenValidation",
            "type": "api",
            "endpoint": "/api/auth/validate-reset-token",
            "method": "POST",
            "auto_fetch": true,
            "auth_required": false,
            "loading_strategy": "blocking",
            "params": {
                "token": "{{query.token ?? ''}}",
                "email": "{{query.email ?? ''}}"
            },
            "initLocal": {
                "tokenValid": "{{data.valid ?? false}}"
            },
            "errorHandling": {
                "422": {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": {
                        "target": "local",
                        "tokenError": true
                    }
                },
                "default": {
                    "handler": "setState",
                    "params": {
                        "target": "local",
                        "tokenError": true
                    }
                }
            },
            "comment": "링크의 토큰이 아직 유효한지 먼저 묻는다 — blocking 이라 이 응답 전에는 폼을 그리지 않는다. 422 든 그 밖의 실패든 결과는 하나(토큰 무효 안내)라 두 갈래가 같은 상태를 세운다."
        }
    ],
    "permissions": [],
    "slots": {
        "content": [
            {
                "comment": "본인 계정 모달 - 로그인된 사용자 이메일과 토큰 이메일이 일치하는 경우",
                "type": "composite",
                "name": "Modal",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "type": "click",
                        "event": "onClose",
                        "handler": "navigate",
                        "params": {
                            "path": "/"
                        }
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "isOpen": "{{!!_global?.currentUser?.uuid && query.email === _global?.currentUser?.email}}",
                    "title": "$t:auth.logged_in_redirect.title",
                    "width": "400px",
                    "closeOnBackdropClick": false
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "P",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
                        },
                        "text": "$t:auth.logged_in_redirect.message"
                    },
                    {
                        "comment": "Footer 버튼 영역",
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Div",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "flex justify-end gap-3 mt-6"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Button",
                                "actions": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "click",
                                        "handler": "navigate",
                                        "params": {
                                            "path": "/"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ],
                                "props": {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "className": "px-4 py-2 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-300 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 cursor-pointer"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:auth.logged_in_redirect.go_home"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Button",
                                "actions": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "click",
                                        "handler": "navigate",
                                        "params": {
                                            "path": "/mypage/change-password"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ],
                                "props": {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "className": "px-4 py-2 bg-primary-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:auth.logged_in_redirect.change_password"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "comment": "타인 계정 모달 - 로그인된 사용자 이메일과 토큰 이메일이 다른 경우",
                "type": "composite",
                "name": "Modal",
                "actions": [
                    {
                        "type": "click",
                        "event": "onClose",
                        "handler": "conditions",
                        "conditions": [
                            {
                                "if": "{{!_local.isLoggingOut}}",
                                "then": {
                                    "handler": "navigate",
                                    "params": {
                                        "path": "/"
                                    }
                                }
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "props": {
                    "isOpen": "{{!!_global?.currentUser?.uuid && query.email !== _global?.currentUser?.email}}",
                    "title": "$t:auth.different_account.title",
                    "width": "400px",
                    "closeOnBackdropClick": false
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "P",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
                        },
                        "text": "$t:auth.different_account.message"
                    },
                    {
                        "comment": "Footer 버튼 영역",
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Div",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "flex justify-end gap-3 mt-6"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Button",
                                "actions": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "click",
                                        "handler": "navigate",
                                        "params": {
                                            "path": "/"
                                        }
                                    }
                                ],
                                "props": {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "className": "px-4 py-2 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-300 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                    "disabled": "{{_local.isLoggingOut}}"
                                },
                                "text": "$t:auth.different_account.go_home"
                            },
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Button",
                                "actions": [
                                    {
                                        "comment": "남의 계정으로 로그인한 채 링크를 열었을 때 — 로그아웃하고 화면을 새로 고쳐야 이 화면이 비로그인 상태로 다시 판정된다(navigate 는 같은 경로라 다시 그리지 않는다). 실패하면 잠금을 풀어 다시 누를 수 있게 둔다.",
                                        "type": "click",
                                        "handler": "sequence",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "handler": "setState",
                                                "params": {
                                                    "target": "local",
                                                    "isLoggingOut": true
                                                }
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "handler": "logout",
                                                "onSuccess": {
                                                    "handler": "refresh"
                                                },
                                                "onError": {
                                                    "handler": "sequence",
                                                    "actions": [
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                "isLoggingOut": false
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "handler": "toast",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "type": "error",
                                                                "message": "$t:auth.different_account.logout_failed"
                                                            }
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ],
                                "props": {
                                    "type": "button",
                                    "className": "flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 bg-primary-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                    "disabled": "{{_local.isLoggingOut}}"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "if": "{{_local.isLoggingOut}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "w-4 h-4 border-2 border-white/30 border-t-white rounded-full animate-spin"
                                        }
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Span",
                                        "text": "{{_local.isLoggingOut ? '$t:auth.different_account.logging_out' : '$t:auth.different_account.logout'}}"
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            },
            {
                "type": "basic",
                "name": "Div",
                "blur_until_loaded": "{{_global?.currentUser?.uuid}}",
                "props": {
                    "className": "min-h-[60vh] flex items-center justify-center py-12 px-4"
                },
                "children": [
                    {
                        "comment": "비밀번호 재설정 폼",
                        "type": "basic",
                        "name": "Div",
                        "props": {
                            "className": "w-full max-w-md"
                        },
                        "children": [
                            {
                                "type": "basic",
                                "name": "Div",
                                "responsive": {
                                    "portable": {
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-md p-6"
                                        }
                                    }
                                },
                                "props": {
                                    "className": "bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-md p-8"
                                },
                                "children": [
                                    {
                                        "comment": "헤더",
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "text-center mb-8"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "H1",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2"
                                                },
                                                "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.title"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "P",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400"
                                                },
                                                "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.subtitle"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "comment": "토큰 에러 메시지",
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "if": "{{_local?.tokenError}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "text-center"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "xmark",
                                                            "size": "xl",
                                                            "color": "text-red-600 dark:text-red-400"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "P",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "text-red-700 dark:text-red-300 mb-6"
                                                },
                                                "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.token_invalid"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 justify-center"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Button",
                                                        "actions": [
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "click",
                                                                "handler": "navigate",
                                                                "params": {
                                                                    "path": "/login"
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        ],
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "px-6 py-3 bg-primary-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap"
                                                        },
                                                        "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.go_to_login"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Button",
                                                        "actions": [
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "click",
                                                                "handler": "navigate",
                                                                "params": {
                                                                    "path": "/"
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        ],
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "px-6 py-3 bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-lg hover:bg-gray-300 dark:hover:bg-gray-600 transition-colors cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap"
                                                        },
                                                        "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.go_to_home"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "comment": "성공 메시지",
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Div",
                                        "if": "{{_local?.success && !_local?.tokenError}}",
                                        "props": {
                                            "className": "text-center"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "w-16 h-16 mx-auto mb-4 bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-900/30 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Icon",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "check",
                                                            "size": "xl",
                                                            "color": "text-green-600 dark:text-green-400"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "P",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "text-green-700 dark:text-green-300 mb-4"
                                                },
                                                "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.success"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Button",
                                                "actions": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "click",
                                                        "handler": "navigate",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "path": "/login"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ],
                                                "props": {
                                                    "className": "inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-primary-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors cursor-pointer"
                                                },
                                                "text": "$t:auth.login"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "comment": "폼",
                                        "type": "basic",
                                        "name": "Form",
                                        "if": "{{!_local?.success && !_local?.tokenError}}",
                                        "dataKey": "form",
                                        "actions": [
                                            {
                                                "comment": "재설정 — 지난 오류를 지우고 보낸다. 규칙 위반·재사용(422)은 칸 아래에 싣고(#736), 칸 오류가 없는 실패(만료된 링크 등)만 토스트로 알린다.",
                                                "type": "submit",
                                                "handler": "sequence",
                                                "actions": [
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "setState",
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "target": "local",
                                                            "isSubmitting": true,
                                                            "errors": null
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "handler": "apiCall",
                                                        "target": "/api/auth/reset-password",
                                                        "identity_target": {
                                                            "email": "{{query.email ?? ''}}"
                                                        },
                                                        "params": {
                                                            "method": "POST",
                                                            "body": {
                                                                "token": "{{query.token ?? ''}}",
                                                                "email": "{{query.email ?? ''}}",
                                                                "password": "{{form?.password}}",
                                                                "password_confirmation": "{{form?.password_confirmation}}"
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "onSuccess": {
                                                            "handler": "setState",
                                                            "params": {
                                                                "target": "local",
                                                                "isSubmitting": false,
                                                                "success": true
                                                            }
                                                        },
                                                        "onError": [
                                                            {
                                                                "handler": "setState",
                                                                "params": {
                                                                    "target": "local",
                                                                    "isSubmitting": false,
                                                                    "errors": "{{error.errors ?? null}}"
                                                                }
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "handler": "toast",
                                                                "if": "{{!error.errors?.password && !error.errors?.password_confirmation}}",
                                                                "params": {
                                                                    "type": "error",
                                                                    "message": "{{error.message}}"
                                                                }
                                                            }
                                                        ]
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "props": {
                                            "id": "form",
                                            "className": "space-y-6"
                                        },
                                        "children": [
                                            {
                                                "comment": "새 비밀번호",
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Label",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2"
                                                        },
                                                        "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.password"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "PasswordInput",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "password",
                                                            "placeholder": "$t:auth.reset_password.password_placeholder|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_min_length ?? 8}}",
                                                            "className": "w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                                            "required": true,
                                                            "showToggle": true,
                                                            "showValidation": true,
                                                            "disabled": "{{_local?.isSubmitting ?? false}}",
                                                            "enableRules": "{{['minLength:' + (_global.settings?.security?.password_min_length ?? 8)].concat(_global.settings?.security?.require_password_special_char ? ['hasSpecial'] : [], _global.settings?.security?.password_require_char_types ? ['minTypes:2'] : [])}}",
                                                            "error": "{{_local.errors?.password?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "comment": "화면이 미리 확인할 수 없는 규칙(서버만 판정)은 작은 글로 알린다 — 켜진 것만 보인다(#736).",
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "P",
                                                        "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_reuse_prevention_enabled || !!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_identifier || !!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_repeated_chars || !!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_sequential_chars}}",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "mt-2 flex flex-wrap gap-x-1 text-xs text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400"
                                                        },
                                                        "children": [
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                "name": "Span",
                                                                "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.server_intro"
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                "name": "Span",
                                                                "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_reuse_prevention_enabled}}",
                                                                "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.reuse|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_reuse_count ?? 3}}"
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                "name": "Span",
                                                                "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_identifier}}",
                                                                "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.identifier"
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                "name": "Span",
                                                                "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_repeated_chars}}",
                                                                "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.repeated|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_repeated_chars_length ?? 4}}"
                                                            },
                                                            {
                                                                "type": "basic",
                                                                "name": "Span",
                                                                "if": "{{!!_global.settings?.security?.password_block_sequential_chars}}",
                                                                "text": "$t:auth.password_rules.sequential|count={{_global.settings?.security?.password_sequential_chars_length ?? 4}}"
                                                            }
                                                        ]
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "comment": "비밀번호 확인",
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Div",
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Label",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 mb-2"
                                                        },
                                                        "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.password_confirm"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "PasswordInput",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "name": "password_confirmation",
                                                            "placeholder": "$t:auth.reset_password.password_confirm_placeholder",
                                                            "className": "w-full px-4 py-3 border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-lg bg-white dark:bg-gray-700 text-gray-900 dark:text-white focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary-500 focus:border-transparent disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed",
                                                            "required": true,
                                                            "showToggle": true,
                                                            "isConfirmField": true,
                                                            "confirmTarget": "{{_local?.form?.password ?? ''}}",
                                                            "disabled": "{{_local?.isSubmitting ?? false}}",
                                                            "error": "{{_local.errors?.password_confirmation?.[0] ?? ''}}"
                                                        }
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "comment": "제출 버튼",
                                                "type": "basic",
                                                "name": "Button",
                                                "props": {
                                                    "type": "submit",
                                                    "className": "w-full py-3 bg-primary-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-primary-700 transition-colors font-medium disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed flex items-center justify-center gap-2",
                                                    "disabled": "{{_local?.isSubmitting ?? false}}"
                                                },
                                                "children": [
                                                    {
                                                        "comment": "스피너",
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Div",
                                                        "if": "{{_local?.isSubmitting}}",
                                                        "props": {
                                                            "className": "w-5 h-5 border-2 border-white/30 border-t-white rounded-full animate-spin"
                                                        }
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                        "if": "{{!_local?.isSubmitting}}",
                                                        "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.submit"
                                                    },
                                                    {
                                                        "type": "basic",
                                                        "name": "Span",
                                                        "if": "{{_local?.isSubmitting}}",
                                                        "text": "$t:auth.reset_password.processing"
                                                    }
                                                ]
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        ]
    }
}
